The query in 1result.sql is the most reliable:

• It picks the primary language correctly by flattening the JSON, ranking by byte count, and keeping only the top‑ranked language.  
• It compares languages case‑insensitively, so repositories are not missed because of letter‑case differences.  
• It counts DISTINCT commit hashes, ensuring an accurate commit total even if duplicates exist in the sample table.  

